      <title>Orbit 2026.11.7.2215</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 22:15:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611072215</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.11.7.2215</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://github.com/siosphere/orbit-updates/releases/tag/v202611072215</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <orbit:note>New Note and New Easel are now in the + menu at the bottom of the sidebar.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Named Safari 17+ profiles now appear as separate checkboxes in the Import card.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The Changelog and What's new card now show release notes for past updates.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The speaker icon on tab rows stays in place when hovered, so the mute tooltip now shows.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Dragging a file over the app no longer splits the window.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Chromium flags are now accessible from the Developer menu, with a relaunch prompt after changes.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Quick switcher rows now show the site's real icon instead of a grey globe placeholder.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>After updating, a sidebar card shows release notes, and Help ▸ What's New opens the full changelog.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>An empty command bar now lists this window's recently visited tabs, newest first, so you can jump back.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Background saves that were silently dropped on Windows due to a brief file lock now complete successfully.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>…and 5 more changes</orbit:note>
